<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρί̆μῐτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>three-threaded,</i> i. e.
			perh. <i>made of drill,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελματικὴ . . τρίμιτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Edict.Diocl.</u>
					19.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				3.228
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Pessinus</span>); but used of felt shoes
			(dub. sens.) in <i><span class="en">
				Lysipp.
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίμιτος, ὁ,</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίμιτον, τό,</span>
			<i>garment of drill</i> or <i>ticking,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
			</span></i> Jun.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.78
			</span></i>: 
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριμίτιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.165
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριμίσκον.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
